00:10:24,000 --> 00:10:30,000
Faces of Death II is a documentary, horror film directed by John Alan Schwartz.

3
00:15:36,000 --> 00:15:42,000
Brief scenes of death related material: mortuaries, accidents and
police work are filmed by TV crews and home video cameras.

4
00:20:48,000 --> 00:20:54,000
Some of it is most likely fake, some not as much.

5
00:26:00,000 --> 00:26:06,000
Dr. Francis B. Gröss, played by Michael Carr.

6
